KiCad Track Gloss
=================

The octolinear smoothing foundation in this package is adapted from
KiCadRoutingTools by DrAndyHaas:

    https://github.com/drandyhaas/KiCadRoutingTools

The active project repository is the fca1 KiCadRoutingTools fork:

    https://github.com/fca1/KiCadRoutingTools

Derived concepts include track-chain recognition, 0/45/90-degree shortcut
search, improvement gating, geometry checks, and connectivity preservation.
The standalone plugin provides selection-seeded scoping, an API-neutral gloss
engine, KiCad 10 SWIG adaptation, deterministic batch planning, live-board
rollback, diagnostics, regression fixtures, branding, and PCM packaging.

The original MIT license and copyright notice are preserved in LICENSE.
Nothing in this package presents the derived smoothing foundation as an
entirely new invention.
